What is Digital Traffic Safety Solution?
Digital traffic safety solutions are integrated platforms that combine artificial intelligence (AI), Internet of Things (IoT) sensors, big‑data analytics and cloud computing to monitor road conditions in real time, predict collision risk and trigger automated alerts through intelligent transportation systems (ITS) and vehicle‑to‑infrastructure (V2I) communication. By fusing video‑analytics, edge‑compute nodes and high‑bandwidth connectivity, these solutions enable municipalities to shift from reactive incident response to proactive risk mitigation.
